 in a virtual reality environment. It's perfect for those who want to improve their auditory memory, auditory-visual association and listening in challenging situations, such as understanding speech with distorted sounds or with competitive noises in the environment (auditory closure and auditory figure-ground discrimination).\n\nThis game is designed to be challenging but fun, and it's perfect for players of all ages.", "short_description": "Supermarket VR is a game that transports you to a supermarket on a space station. Train your cognitive skills by memorizing the names of the products on the list, and identifying sounds in a noisy environment. Fun and challenging for players of all ages."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://termos.probrain.com.br/pub/policies/policies_eng.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ProBrain Solu\u00e7\u00f5es Neurotecnol\u00f3gicas para Sa\u00fade e Educa\u00e7\u00e3o Ltda", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.probrain.com.br/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "pt_BR"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "6564857710296707"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "986659505945754"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "986659505945754"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1695405981, "status": "PUBLISH